{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That\u2019s My Tofu</strong> is a fast-paced VR cooking game where family dinner turns into full-blown chaos. Gather around a bubbling hotpot, cook your ingredients to perfection, and race to serve them before your mischievous cousin swoops in and steals them straight from the pot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with chopsticks, you\u2019ll test your precision, speed, and reflexes as you juggle cooking, serving, and desperately defending your tofu in a lively, chaotic feast where nobody plays fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\udd62Cook with chopsticks and skewers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick up, poke, and serve food using VR motion controls designed to feel like the real thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977020/extras/ce0102d5605670cdc0f3ba2008f243f1.poster.avif?t=1774731771\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977020/extras/ce0102d5605670cdc0f3ba2008f243f1.webm?t=1774731771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977020/extras/ce0102d5605670cdc0f3ba2008f243f1.mp4?t=1774731771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddc8<strong>Defend your tofu</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fend off your sneaky cousin who tries to steal food right out of the pot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977020/extras/71af2229fa908da732006e479629ac18.poster.avif?t=1774731771\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977020/extras/71af2229fa908da732006e479629ac18.webm?t=1774731771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977020/extras/71af2229fa908da732006e479629ac18.mp4?t=1774731771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> \ud83d\udd25<strong>Chaotic party energy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A mix of precision cooking and slapstick defense makes every session unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977020/extras/42d7e8de63ee8a117d835ab523de7a14.poster.avif?t=1774731771\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977020/extras/42d7e8de63ee8a117d835ab523de7a14.webm?t=1774731771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977020/extras/42d7e8de63ee8a117d835ab523de7a14.mp4?t=1774731771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf72Multiple recipes &amp; ingredients</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From meats and veggies to tofu and skewers, every dish feels unique to cook and serve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977020/extras/7eb4e8c03a4bc1d5c415978d6475475f.p